{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"当Access_Token超时后，使用refresh_token进行刷新，每次刷新都会产生新的access_token和Refresh_Token，同时重置二者的有效期。还介绍了Token刷新的不同场景逻辑。配合接口有获取Access Token。\",\"id\":\"oauth2.token.refresh\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/oauth2/refresh_token/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1829552986209882\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"oauth2.token.get\",\"path\":\"/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access Token才能进行刷新操作\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1829552986209882\",\"title\":\"刷新Token\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j5O0bCQ2\">由于Access_Token有效期（默认1天）较短,当Access_Token超时后，可以使用refresh_token进行刷新，每次刷新都会产生新的access_token和Refresh_Token，同时重置二者的有效期。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-NnVo2kzm\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j4HzQguv\">Refresh_Token有效期是30天，但是刷新后会产生新的Refresh_token，老的Refresh_token会过期</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-K0kjhjIX\">为防止Token刷新后新token由于某些原因可能存储失败，导致无法使用问题，刷新后历史Token将保留10分钟的有效时间，具体场景逻辑如下：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-CktGddkO\"><strong>场景一：Token被刷新</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-f7VRPwXE\">只要Token刷新成功获得了新的Access_Token和Refresh_Token，老的Access_Token和Refresh_Token将继续保留10分钟的有效期，10分钟后会自动过期；如果10分钟内对老的Token再次刷新，不再刷新老Token的时间，即老Token刷新后的10分钟有效期从第一次刷新时间开始。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-SpH82YSt\"><strong>场景二：重新授权获得新的auth_code</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sZvaYVsL\">同以往，只要重新授权了，那历史auth_code和Token将立即失效；</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ga4ZTHws\"><strong>场景三：客户取消授权</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vpdFAwfk\">同以往，APPID下与此客户相关的auth_code和Token立即过期；</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201758444633982980%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fGKASZoW\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-cQNe3G5e\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/refresh_token/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/refresh_token/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1697468248190020\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ekJNPB5h\" id=\"link-1\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-n6wwSwHQ\"><strong>POST</strong></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-3mSxGqRW\" id=\"link-2\">请求Header</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-D0AnHOmK\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-kbIfS8Et\"><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-1fEplt0Q\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-uiZGWfE7\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-mCHHnKVj\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-xBfUfs2A\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-x0zSLAX8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-guQP3nUy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7VY7lKmc\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-6sarzeIL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NjSNsQdN\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-q7Gsdni6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F2zwFr1a\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-1PXVI44x\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-HhM53MEh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GnGO5F56\">Content-Type</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-g49BOyMA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dx4IRWm5\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-aCwwRj3k\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Gmhc1GDn\">请求消息类型，允许值：<span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyiLR%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">application/json</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-zybSdvsS\" id=\"link-3\">请求参数</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-HOUMq848\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-ZydCg8xt\"><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-rVbsI3wS\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-aphscj6f\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"ce664ee5-qW2erpPQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-Fg9AtCuJ\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-l5D6J1Zy\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-nC9ByU2o\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IxamAtSL\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-9XyTj2WW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S30DWXkP\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-DGZ7NVOa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yNi742Eq\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-g3ZGOXod\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-2M7qNR2m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fI8bzYq2\">app_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-WeskgdiI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iV0NC7fk\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-zGAYPYZM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8cnmLART\">开发者申请的应用APP_ID，可通过“<span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">应用管理</span>”界面查看</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dQNhIFty\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-lTRod8Af\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pQIw4s1f\">secret<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-DHi5URd8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5GNUY8PT\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-VMowItkK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YJmHZ1cK\">开发者应用的私钥Secret，可通过“<span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">应用管理</span>”界面查看（<span style=\"color: #f24408;\">确保填入secret与app_id对应以免报错！</span>）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-qoKgSa80\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-Zy0G3TGg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R7TBrDMM\">grant_type<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-zkcSfrHp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mVfqXtSr\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-WPjKd78H\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1fUxLh7N\">授权类型。允许值: </p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-UMb5Prwy\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-dwyQcFCE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mQfZdai5\">refresh_token<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-gn6Ges0M\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-288czHYy\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-CgUMOHMD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ScT7l1eq\">刷新token,从\"<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取Access Token</span></a>\"和“<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506097679\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">刷新Access Token</span></a>”的返回结果中得到)，刷新后会过期，请及时保存最新的token</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-XwvTsfJO\" id=\"link-4\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22def%20refresh_access_token()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20import%20requests%5Cn%20%20%20%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20uri%20%3D%20%5C%22oauth2%2Frefresh_token%2F%5C%22%5Cn%20%2